  "interpretation": {
    "dense": "Approximate extraction time decreases from about 0.197 to 0.159 ms per frame, while ordinary text-feature time remains near 0.15 ms. The dense median and mean frame times improve by about 1.3 and 1.9 percent in this brief comparison. This supports the narrow extraction optimization, with no statistical speedup claim.",
    "empty": "Approximate extraction time decreases only slightly, near the precision of the rounded profiler shares. Median frame time improves, but mean and tail times worsen. No overall empty-scene performance improvement is established.",
